# docs/ are local working notes for the project author, except for the
# reproducible README figures and their generator.
# Not tracked because they are session-scratch (investigation receipts,
# design drafts) that clutter diffs without serving collaborators.
# The author keeps them locally and pastes relevant ones into Claude
# conversations as needed.
docs/*
!docs/figures/
!docs/figures/**

